  era: "c. 300 BCE \u2013 17th c. CE \xB7 Section 38 \xB7 Historiography \xB7 How we know the past"
  title: Foreign travellers
  text: 'Visitors left valuable accounts: Megasthenes at the Mauryan court, the Buddhist pilgrims Faxian and Xuanzang, Al-Biruni''s Kitab-ul-Hind, Ibn Battuta in the Tughlaq period, and Europeans such as Bernier and Tavernier under the Mughals.'
